sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant W as Web app
    participant AS as Auth service
    participant D as Database

    U->>W: E-mail and password
    W->>AS: login(email, password)
    AS->>D: Read user by e-mail
    D-->>AS: user with password hash
    alt Wrong e-mail or password
        AS-->>W: Invalid e-mail or password
        W-->>U: Same message for both cases
    else Credentials correct, account not verified
        AS-->>W: Not verified
        W-->>U: Offer to resend the code
    else Credentials correct, account verified
        AS->>D: Create session
        AS-->>W: Session with user and role
        W-->>U: Home page for the role
    end
